# scenario: shell-locked-blocked
# doc: shell-locked-blocked.md
# given: invoked as `claudine compose --claude --yolo shell-locked-blocked.md` from the directory holding the fixture documents
# given: shell approval is granted by --yolo
# given: the body transcludes a file that does not exist, so preflight fails after initialize
# given: the blocked shell is reached before start, while shells are locked
# given: the provider never launches
event initialize
event blocked
err composition.failed
event failure
err uncoded: shell commands are forbidden during initialize and before preflight completes; move the command to start or a later event
event finalize
err uncoded: shell commands are forbidden during initialize and before preflight completes; move the command to start or a later event
exit 1
